{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_3000_place", "source_sha256": "c64c38d902bb19f98149bc99572b70d1ec55889154b219f18e5eba59c465a5ac", "ja": "サイン会会場", "zh": "签名会会场", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_3001_p", "source_sha256": "1f423b0465df54d9348dff52da240848931bf04b485d15b831f03626b75a30cd", "ja": "もうすぐ開場だけど……志保、準備はできてるか？\n緊張してないか？", "zh": "马上就要开场了……志保，你准备好了吗？\n你会不会紧张？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_3002_033sih", "source_sha256": "a07d94a02d87b0039c09cf6f08802949fc206f84c8c5d4fd56b566dd7f3727d7", "ja": "言われなくてもできています。サイン会は、\nファンの人達と直接会える、大切な場ですし。", "zh": "不用你来叮咛，我也会准备好的。\n毕竟签名会是和粉丝面对面的重要场合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_3003_033sih", "source_sha256": "4167f4742c5189287720e8fc84c21bec669272b816e645394495777aa11246a8", "ja": "みなさん、わざわざ私に会いに来てくれたんです。\nその気持ちに応えるためにも、ちゃんとしなくちゃ。", "zh": "大家是特地来看我的，\n为了回应他们的心意，我得好好表现才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_3004_p", "source_sha256": "f0227877337ac2866a3293d50bb3cc593d1b296988ea5ddd69956deb1a68011e", "ja": "そうだな、ごめんごめん……あれ？\n志保、絵を描いてたのか。", "zh": "的确呢，抱歉、抱歉……嗯？\n志保，你在画画啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_3005_033sih", "source_sha256": "07acb94d4f9aeee106cc1c85715c40b481254ad11f348e4041c76aa769da138a", "ja": "こ、これは……サインにどうかと思って、\n考えてみただけです。何か、おかしいですか？", "zh": "这、这是……我想要设计来当签名的，\n有什么奇怪的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_3006", "source_sha256": "f161f8a1da3d9709b6a119b5218bb43561ca7d1adeaef280a41a78108900ce59", "ja": "かわいい", "zh": "很可爱", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_3007", "source_sha256": "be7c611b97e64d089092a105b5c349f422a3d4229c01cb6354dc0ca45dced3d8", "ja": "志保らしい", "zh": "很有志保的风格", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_3200_p", "source_sha256": "6d88d6758683e580af4e3399b26ba90bd56881239446b6cb4f80393c412c0761", "ja": "いや、おかしくないよ。可愛くていいんじゃないか？\n猫のイラスト……志保は猫が好きなんだな。", "zh": "不，不会奇怪啊，还满可爱的吧？\n猫咪的图案……志保喜欢猫啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_3201_033sih", "source_sha256": "7fb2ff5313481867ef0f15ec6174a9adcf021feffcdbbe3f0a652c9bb960f07c", "ja": "好きっていうか……まぁ……\nそうですね……。", "zh": "与其说喜欢……嗯……\n是没错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_3202_p", "source_sha256": "09682b385691f1325289e306f508e32fffca17d94e73a5598cc739e84e1e6f36", "ja": "志保が一生懸命考えたサインだ。\nファンの人達も、きっと喜んでくれると思う！", "zh": "这是志保努力设计出的签名，\n我想那些粉丝一定也会很高兴的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_3203_033sih", "source_sha256": "ec9711a0b5213daf5b12ce8b5b783715c4d2f88e58ec26a1af69e28f803b20b7", "ja": "も、もういいじゃないですか。そんなに、\nほめるほどのことじゃないですから……。", "zh": "也、也说够了吧，\n又不是什么值得夸奖的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_3204_033sih", "source_sha256": "9f01acbf1dcc69b74b50253fc52a6066977c7cbe19fcf218f426207ef1f91325", "ja": "それより、そろそろ始まりますから。行きますよ。\nお客さんを待たせるわけには、いきませんからね。", "zh": "别说这个了，活动差不多要开始了，我走了喔。\n可不能让客人等我呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_3300_p", "source_sha256": "6d88d6758683e580af4e3399b26ba90bd56881239446b6cb4f80393c412c0761", "ja": "いや、おかしくないよ。可愛くていいんじゃないか？\n猫のイラスト……志保は猫が好きなんだな。", "zh": "不，不会奇怪啊，还满可爱的吧？\n猫咪的图案……志保喜欢猫啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_3301_033sih", "source_sha256": "713ebe0f56c73fcbb4f97d72e3aec1efc274d2d1c0d7b0503346a2bf6255a01d", "ja": "そ、そうですか……。\nおかしくないなら、いいです。", "zh": "这、这样吗……\n不会奇怪就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_3302_033sih", "source_sha256": "8e7dad78a8cd1daf57ca3e9ead94f6114d6dd4c7558fcad0dc04b11d09d1a730", "ja": "別に……サインなんて、名前がわかれば、それで……。\nかわいい、かわいくない、なんて関係ないですし……。", "zh": "反正……签名这种东西，只要看得懂名字就行……\n和可不可爱没什么关系……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_3500_p", "source_sha256": "88b2a4f01ffb5c5cccede4e8813966fbb7463da5467fda73a69e6bc19b0e8c20", "ja": "志保らしくていいと思うぞ。\nすっきりした、綺麗なサインだな。", "zh": "我觉得很有志保的风格，很好啊。\n是简洁又漂亮的签名呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_3501_033sih", "source_sha256": "1c0f31920700f10e9268b93de942009f80d4bee7cc89010fc4008433dc80d151", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます。\n自分でも……気に入ってるんです。", "zh": "谢、谢谢你。\n我自己也……很喜欢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_3502_p", "source_sha256": "4978a7e5c66580a7423c12267d32d737cb052c5b65fd18c4cda53068ca189fb7", "ja": "今日のために、ずいぶん練習したんだろう？\n本当に、志保は努力家だな。", "zh": "为了今天，你花了不少时间练习吧？\n志保真努力啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_3503_033sih", "source_sha256": "200ffd7dfbcb6e6b830ca23108bc79d720eebab9c536faec650abe8de6df2b87", "ja": "このくらい、アイドルとして当然のことですから。\nこんなことで、感心しないでもらえませんか。", "zh": "身为偶像，这是理所当然的，\n你可以不要为了这种小事就感到佩服吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_3504_033sih", "source_sha256": "8348a1631f1c9e088d768abce90dad31298df147ed7c6b99c83ab47c7a903d17", "ja": "でも、一応お礼は言っておきます。\nありがとうございます、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "但我姑且还是向你道谢，\n谢谢你，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_3600_p", "source_sha256": "88b2a4f01ffb5c5cccede4e8813966fbb7463da5467fda73a69e6bc19b0e8c20", "ja": "志保らしくていいと思うぞ。\nすっきりした、綺麗なサインだな。", "zh": "我觉得很有志保的风格，很好啊。\n是简洁又漂亮的签名呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_3601_033sih", "source_sha256": "7a9d6c7a43fbf1175f92ec0b15ae222b5bccc0935fbf5e934c1420fa0f477435", "ja": "そうですか。{$P$}さんの言う\n私らしさって、何なのかよくわかりませんけど……。", "zh": "是这样吗？虽然不太清楚{$P$}先生\n所谓的我的风格是什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_3602_033sih", "source_sha256": "4af567cea1b6d2fbca6440d2bb42dee58bae656d7946e794657a44dc33d6882c", "ja": "でも、まぁ、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "不过，好吧，谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
